geniousRiley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:23:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Prevent overlapping catalogue writes and stale refresh results (#103)\n\n* Keep catalogue writes exclusive and reject superseded reads\n\n* Await controlled read promises in ordering tests\n\n* Queue refresh fixtures after the initial catalogue load\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: IngeniousRiley <336672273+IngeniousRiley@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2af64a3aca4c8d7d11d540bdeb937910520999dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/saas-fabric/git/trees/2af64a3aca4c8d7d11d540bdeb937910520999dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/saas-fabric/git/commits/e478d7def533d3a1bc73dff79e1a48afdc9ed0e0","verification":{"payload":"tree 2af64a3aca4c8d7d11d540bdeb937910520999dd\nparent d3528d07c963f30ff28430f124793dd0e462750a\nauthor IngeniousRiley <riley@pukekos.co.nz> 1791393794 +1300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791393794 +1300\n\nPrevent overlapping catalogue writes and stale refresh results (#103)\n\n* Keep catalogue writes exclusive and reject superseded reads\n\n* Await controlled read promises in ordering tests\n\n* Queue refresh fixtures after the initial catalogue load\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: IngeniousRiley <336672273+IngeniousRiley@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxoACCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABRgQACrdERVF6cH1oRMrWNH/NLmw\nX+LgiWiwzM0yqZr1ohC8dJRRxkUX3MzXXNe5WzorGbzWULWbq+BRyltNk1ZbIpY6\ndwVjELCPg7nWrP3XlBSwSJsgDAdoQ28sKZ1SiSOLP1SkjzEfm7YC3b2XeWRkIbWG\nshrUDX+SekZV6Hl5KSQoMe0S+8Arc457ATRGg5ZmmX3tR9BpmrhC5zyLoIe70m0V\nOG+US3OD3yv6ImDsDfjSNB8KW1uHETgxJ650VrnsybbJxi6qtzzrzvyvutjkjCBi\n5mWpWatJpeWBI/0f/NuJRuk7gDHj+K38ff/0f7jtMD5ejHnK298xPsx6xZEJa1+i\nAjNf8q1XFH5uhYED0AL14/LXE+zaqQ/c8ftvxjWMpB7RBN0KFR//acic/2YdWS/r\notpZNSs51WAnpncIa