stateNZ/saas-fabric/commits/d3528d07c963f30ff28430f124793dd0e462750a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T16:40:56Z","email":"brett@pukekos.co.nz","name":"Brett Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T16:40:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(data-api): refuse NUL in caller text; connector recovery, isolation and mismatch acceptance (#130)\n\n* test(ndc): let acceptance tests restart the connector and publish in sequence\n\nPin the connector''s host port so a restarted container is reachable at the\nURL the client negotiated against, add Stack::start_connector, raw request\nbodies, per-logical-name tenant bindings and catalogues, and sequential\npublication.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DU1CMkx64XgQPMRUBG4oUY\n\n* test(ndc): connector recovery, isolation and mismatch acceptance (#113)\n\nRestart and recovery, filters and pagination over a shared key, catalogue\nand tenant publication skew, and malformed requests, all against real\nndc-postgres.\n\nRefs #113\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DU1CMkx64XgQPMRUBG4oUY\n\n* fix(data-api): refuse NUL in caller text as a 400, not a 500\n\nPostgreSQL cannot store U+0000, and a key, filter or body field containing\none surfaced as a 500 execution_failed. It is the caller''s malformed input,\nso it is now refused with bad_request before any connector is reached.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DU1CMkx64XgQPMRUBG4oUY\n\n* test(ndc): assert the NUL refusal and re-keying behaviour the connector showed (#113)\n\nA PATCH that changes a key field is well-formed and moves only the caller''s\nrow, so it moves out of the malformed set into its own isolation test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DU1CMkx64XgQPMRUBG4oUY\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e919e1302caba91c53f302bc850220d277242bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/saas-fabric/git/trees/0e919e1302caba91c53f302bc850220d277242bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/saas-fabric/git/commits/d3528d07c963f30ff28430f124793dd0e462750a","verification":{"payload":"tree 0e919e1302caba91c53f302bc850220d277242bd\nparent e1952905830cb85713efb2f7603cd5839c43f023\nauthor Brett Smith <brett@pukekos.co.nz> 1791391256 +1300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791391256 +1300\n\nfix(data-api): refuse NUL in caller text; connector recovery, isolation and mismatch acceptance (#130)\n\n* test(ndc): let acceptance tests restart the connector and publish in sequence\n\nPin the connector''s host port so a restarted container is reachable at the\nURL the client negotiated against, add Stack::start_connector, raw request\nbodies, per-logical-name tenant bindings and catalogues, and sequential\npublication.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DU1CMkx64XgQPMRUBG4oUY\n\n* test(ndc): connector recovery, isolation and mismatch acceptance (#113)\n\nRestart and recovery, filters and pagination over a shared key, catalogue\nand tenant publication skew, and malformed requests, all against real\nndc-postgres.\n\nRefs #113\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DU1CMkx64XgQPMRUBG4oUY\n\n* fix(data-api): refuse NUL in caller text as a 400, not a 500\n\nPostgreSQL cannot store U+0000, and a key, filter or body field containing\none surfaced as a 500 execution_failed. It is the caller''s malformed input,\nso it is now refused with bad_request before any connector is reached.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DU1CMkx64XgQPMRUBG4oUY\n\n* test(ndc): assert the NUL refusal and re-keying behaviour the connector showed (#113)\n\nA PATCH that changes a key field is well-formed and moves only the caller''s\nrow, so it moves out of the malformed set into its own isolation test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DU1CMkx64XgQPMRUBG4oUY\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxnYYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAx3QQAJbY/7yzWBl64Cy7YfzEhdoX\nrexbqsY0czDTu6fPEknjXPaVcmkjBmIeANb3P1Ry91hpsFAe2MYD5PSOJiunTcOw\nGXGCPKzfbKlTOFlzHsP4seuHX7F4xDEQm2NCJIDoRyytJoUZGOfstv1/R58BZiEy\nJiuBkrfxjzO6/YedekhYjXY0pZCs6FMPwJCUe2xQep8I+MCJzGi+puZViK50tIUZ\nF4AkESV2KvXLXi+Hb5PfY5HMPwirZVpgGGBdgKRwt4qFuoOCkv589KY2N14CSJUZ\nXebN6pEBDi5s6XZeO0kXOsH2dXvlDLckn3J6G1wcZ7ijN0S56pPH7XqkjHKP1orD\nqVTVlLnzTCnbW//6lfON8pzWIEdKpSGdSrQLSgQMEVMu9YvNDKQNoUTyBK1CdC0J\n4kdyCYzOm58Met4R8EK8x09AVcRtAyoBDwytNhgOz7hYSglqX+irioF/IOSEMXaM\nbijxH590S0+PBQ6OQclvGoQ34DqOBHRa61qsQ/FKZOfVKUMUbI5L2wAYIJpdtmQ7\nw/0guN0/bCVlDOkLStnHy+m3W+DZJMe30X1eCfZqnmlU5iXDJu9dw+m4VVw4WQuG\nE7XjuqinDO+v38/mKvrCDou2LycpygGhZfIjsDFwBtX4zO43+SgEArHPZ8J0i7S1\nsYC1ZQ6EFeHshfu0LfBb\n=67v+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T16:40:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https:/